{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "7ed68415d90ebbec26146622bb2b65bff1e5a347c9adc09290604a661ea0c9ea", "ja": "トゥインクル☆猛特訓", "zh": "闪亮☆猛烈特训", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "86da132563ee653ea42922c1804a3681b6e73d296dceead5ba1642946af59c09", "ja": "レッスンに励むものの、伸び悩むふたりの\nトゥインクルリズム。そこに現れた真が\nふたりの先生となり、演技指導を行う。\n道のりが遠くてもあきらめずに突き進み、\n立派な魔法少女を目指すふたりだった。", "zh": "两位『闪亮节奏』成员努力练习，\n却遇上了瓶颈。此时，真出现在两人面前，\n当起她们的演技老师。\n为了成为出色的魔法少女，即使路途遥远，\n她们俩也不愿放弃、勇往直前。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "01e76cf2495150cfcc1c69ad8e0367db4713ace8e6d23c486f645b85aa913789", "ja": "（『トゥインクルリズム』のレッスンは続いている。\n今日は百合子と春香が仕事で外出中か）", "zh": "（『闪亮节奏』的练习课程持续进行中。\n今天百合子和春香离开剧场去工作了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b9244268638fa295a9bb3423eabaca90de068adc35b69ec39a210c099d7f79b5", "ja": "（育と亜利沙は\n劇場の近くでレッスンしているはずだが……）", "zh": "（育和亚利沙\n应该是在剧场附近练习……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "871c507bf0295c6139f55b730e25514e235721c35f43fe68f018b6610d5691b0", "ja": "ぎょ、ギョーカイジンめ～っ！\nもう許さないんだから！　えいっ！", "zh": "可、可恶的业界怪人～！\n饶不了你们！看我的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ee722f77df1b0e773d1a8d6df591017a415fd2bac7d1d32e01c29c578314214c", "ja": "（うーん、育はがんばって役になりきろうとしてる\nけど、どうしても、ちょっと可愛すぎるな……）", "zh": "（唔……育很努力想要融入角色，\n但无论她再怎么努力，还是稍嫌可爱了点……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "ac38dd22c4d3c6ade03a807c8566a0c0f7e05664fbdb726ec458515daa43f651", "ja": "ムホッ！？　シースー団に囲まれたわー！　今のうちに\nへんし……へんしゅい……やーん！　また噛みました！", "zh": "唔齁！？被司寿团包围了～！\n快趁现在变……变森……讨厌啦～！又吃螺丝了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "38de55fd0b458e6edaf444e2ae19df9e75ea5e902074e5ce7572a1276d158c6b", "ja": "（亜利沙も頑張っているが、演技が厳しそうだ。それに\n魔法少女がムホッ！なんて言っちゃダメだろう……）", "zh": "（亚利沙也很努力，但看来演技依旧有待加强。\n而且魔法少女怎么可以大喊「唔齁！」啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "f081d8447daf1d0246de67647cf08429d5e62d972224d0e45fd08885e37bfea6", "ja": "トゥインクルパワー全開！\nギロッポンなんかに負けないんだからっ！", "zh": "闪亮力量全开！\n我才不会输给木六本！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ce55dabb363a7093e7ac0cad817d1f34b54af75de912c524685c2238eec3d62f", "ja": "育、亜利沙、お疲れさま！", "zh": "育、亚利沙，练习辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "bde7d2ac1ebb7d4630b2156be97d215da08dae9f697e574f85e13ad91661cfd1", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　\n来てくれたんだ！　お疲れさまです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n你来啦！辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "78383bcd3aafb8882ad31cdfd6cf46f08a5370041bd0a502569d501c89abe463", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nお疲れさまです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7883eb6b782a092b7fd813c9e6b0ed704ec44f2b38b91a972f364bf762ab9176", "ja": "二人とも、レッスンは順調か？", "zh": "你们两个练习得还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "9305f858fc941d085a49482b03a67d6aad24bdd3e97fc85bd266575848b4bb33", "ja": "ううん……。あのね、たくさん練習してるんだけど、\nなんかうまくいかないの。", "zh": "不顺利……那个啊，我练习了很久，\n可是都没有进步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "1b3f59ed4379811e69a0e6908b3ffad7494d9bf66e204eab62438462e6ca5628", "ja": "ありさもですぅ～。せっかくカメラもありさメモも\n封印して、気合い入れてるのに……。", "zh": "亚利沙也是～都已经收起照相机和亚利沙笔记，\n那么努力练习了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a0c811cc3a8bb9c02c25f4d682de2e09b439c5d71bbcc8513c03a4f4849834d5", "ja": "なるほど。じつは、そんなことだろうと思って、\n今日は先生に来てもらってるんだ。", "zh": "原来是这样。其实，我也担心你们可能会遇到瓶颈，\n所以今天请了老师过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "2e2f902ea1496def531d1b9175209f20307a7c91b4e144c68b271b807855553b", "ja": "わあ！　教えてくれる人がいるの！？", "zh": "哇！有人要来教我们吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "250e27d31144fde2985b56bcb16e7e1b2c54074c15a6c9762d6c8b6fb8d60ba1", "ja": "育ちゃん、亜利沙、{$P$}！\nおっつかれさまでーす！", "zh": "小育、亚利沙、{$P$}！\n大家辛苦了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "146df4f566ebe9756e3c595328ed1ec064b1dd967e40c8a17c7e691678b5d3d0", "ja": "あっ！　真さん！", "zh": "啊！是真姊姊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1017_p", "source_sha256": "07318291a9d73ec2b673ed23a75c58d0ab5d6c05fa1671f18bc917a3071d5482", "ja": "真は演技もアクションも得意だからな。\n先生として適任だろう。真、任せて大丈夫か？", "zh": "真不管是演技和动作戏都很擅长，\n所以我想她会是很好的老师。真，可以交给你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "f4559eb7a887cab70cdbabb6c3f869403382ab16ea837788158dbb5e3b06d875", "ja": "へへっ、もちろんですよ！　かわいい後輩の\n悩みのためなら、一肌も二肌も脱ぎますって！", "zh": "嘿嘿！当然没问题！为了解决可爱后辈的烦恼，\n在下赴汤蹈火在所不辞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "f3d37e38f29ce08285f33332ea95b35f301e1369e5bbb4b1628da16f9b74d4d7", "ja": "ムフゥーっ！！\n真くんが脱ぎ……脱……ゴホン！", "zh": "唔呼～！！\n阿真要泡汤……泡……咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "b278513123b4d7fc001f448a46f7c41c303b6c15f4060e9d1f65515350a5e6ba", "ja": "亜利沙さん……顔がにやけてるよ……？", "zh": "亚利沙姊姊……你的嘴都笑歪了耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1021_p", "source_sha256": "dfb551776378b580c4069fc2d5e2d1264217127d0d4cd31b87439dfcf6754caa", "ja": "亜利沙……ちゃんとするんだぞ。\nそれじゃ、真、この二人にレッスンを……。", "zh": "亚利沙……你要好好练习喔。\n好啦，真，她们俩就交给你训练……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "edc3b02448f17affb873928042fbc6b5975007646f02a6d02e23f96e56bcb645", "ja": "はい！　任せてください、{$P$}！", "zh": "好的！包在在下身上，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1023_006mak", "source_sha256": "d36d68b14842540f7de0835f93040aa368a8134382e4410d1ed10a1dc0444913", "ja": "それじゃ、ふたりの演技を改めて見てみたいから\n一度、リハしてみようか！", "zh": "那么，在下想先重新看看你们俩的演技，\n再排演一次吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1026_null", "source_sha256": "b51dfd95602ddeba2076b904866bddd2d33de5044a97d39d914d7a5836a1edaa", "ja": "そして…………", "zh": "然后…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1027_006mak", "source_sha256": "aa18bd717cae0416747dceac0391da10b3d8796037d0cb2a5dfb429aa9779ea6", "ja": "うーん……なるほど……。", "zh": "唔……原来如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1028_p", "source_sha256": "db3fc247858eb71649ead5c54d1829d0c7587788396aac50c80d1f1594c86404", "ja": "真、どうすればいいと思う？", "zh": "真，你觉得该怎么改善？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "51275898dc64a51bdbb6ee2021f5fa9214a07ed239aea22fcc7261bb24fb78cb", "ja": "そうだなぁ。問題はいろいろあるみたいですが、\n要はビシバシッとかっこよく動ければ全部OKですよ！", "zh": "这个嘛～虽然看来有很多问题，\n但基本上只要把动作做得帅气俐落，就全部OK了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "292f96f358600c8453166860ba9483ad9c4c3c20fb581718a34f418e7d015ac9", "ja": "おお……！", "zh": "喔喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1031_p", "source_sha256": "c4c881a22b241359569984020b3d72c015e1632bf2a2816bf47e8a1b41e3c8ce", "ja": "確かに、そうか。かっこよく見える……。\nそれがすべての根底かもしれない。", "zh": "的确，有道理。帅气的动作……\n这可能是全部的基础。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1032_006mak", "source_sha256": "05d0389a6aa127fc3008840164c98d2dd92cbeff739bc9b4356845e4924b4aa2", "ja": "さっそく特訓してみようか。\nまずお手本を見せるよ。", "zh": "那就马上特训看看吧。\n在下先示范一次喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1033_006mak", "source_sha256": "6c0bd44c4374d6ce3ec6086948b65e8b1a33bf9ff0a5ada2fd7835fb6c56e2ec", "ja": "アクションって言っても、構え過ぎないようにね。\nダンスの時の姿勢を思い出して！", "zh": "虽然说要有武打动作，但也不用太刻意。\n你们想想跳舞时的姿势就知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1034_006mak", "source_sha256": "073b65727a85738227ad94e79c453f9add462bb0ab93fa56f455b9dc73ba4195", "ja": "ほら、こんな感じに……でやっ！", "zh": "看，就像这样……嘿呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1035_028ari", "source_sha256": "79208cd84cc768132465caffeb374db38a93146fa4eed97ab74aa773bc53fbbf", "ja": "わあああーーー！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊～～～！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1036_030iku", "source_sha256": "61e28c8148ce5bbd51700e6eb74b2dcff02d7b2ebe7f544d6dca9225accb461e", "ja": "すごい！　真さん、かっこいい！", "zh": "好厉害！真姊姊好帅喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1037_028ari", "source_sha256": "ecfd8f78acb87799cbeec756c832dd3b2272b31296c24eab2b1b7566cb8325c6", "ja": "今のはかっこいい中にも、さりげなく女の子らしい\nしなやかさまで……！　さっそくありさメモに！", "zh": "刚才在帅气之中还自然地带出女生的柔美气质……！\n要赶快写在亚利沙笔记上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "b615f34a77ac1d99f2fa41839dac8df05647fe64a6b206827fc9d7d2a04b85a9", "ja": "はっ、ありさメモは持って来てないんでした！\nううー！　持ってくればよかったですぅ、とほほ……。", "zh": "啊！亚利沙笔记不在身上！\n呜呜～！早知道就带来了～呜呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1039_006mak", "source_sha256": "37b82b418ea44e22fb43c6eb15af69432ae380fe164c050c9787936277a97958", "ja": "よっし！　じゃ、次は演技をやるよ。\n例えばだけど……二人とも、よく見ててね。", "zh": "好！那接下来换演技啰。\n在下示范一下……你们两个看好啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1040_006mak", "source_sha256": "c63b9085a48abe347a60eabd3cf236a4738a4ba666078b4f560f8b8ccb02b3ad", "ja": "「ここに来たって事は、もう覚悟してるんだよね？\n君は……もうボクから逃れられないよ？」", "zh": "「既然你来了，想必有所觉悟了吧？\n你已经……逃不出在下的手掌心了。」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1041_030iku", "source_sha256": "978d4f176a3d0ae773e71a4eeea2c316660451db97706c7810cacc2c51e4d7b8", "ja": "えっ！？　今の、すごい、すごい！", "zh": "哇！？刚才那样好厉害、好厉害喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1042_028ari", "source_sha256": "155284f122c1eb586b921b93222dd27b1543534d8b53e686be04073ac5e4b47b", "ja": "め、メロメロになる演技です！\nありさ感激ですぅ～！！", "zh": "好、好迷人的演技！\n亚利沙好感动喔～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1043_006mak", "source_sha256": "a544c157aa60db01285aca74cb5a96420f4d033faece7895e0f9ddfd1af97d59", "ja": "あはは、大げさだなぁ。要するに、どこまで役を\n自然に意識できるようになるか、だと思うんだけど……", "zh": "哈哈，你也太夸张了。简单来说，\n在下觉得重点在于能自然地融入角色到什么程度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1044_006mak", "source_sha256": "4e98ceb2b4fb4e3c29f6889ad488dbeca50123042ca4f29986942a98937a8f65", "ja": "練習してコツをつかめば、\nみんなできるようになるから。大丈夫！", "zh": "只要多加练习掌握诀窍，\n你们一定也能进步的，放心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1045_030iku", "source_sha256": "131f6f14b6ff2942be276fe6e53be17ddb8e3433f26b35ba60fedfdb0db9f407", "ja": "わたし、決めた！　真さんみたいに、みんなに\n憧れられるステキな女の子になる！", "zh": "我决定了！我要变成像真姊姊一样，\n受大家欢迎、有魅力的女生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1046_006mak", "source_sha256": "ac04d63f5cf266289ec44b57373fc16277acbbc0d33b5dff865ba0e13dc2403f", "ja": "えっ。……ステキな……女の子……？\nへへ、えへへ……やだなぁもう、照れるなぁ♪", "zh": "什么……有魅力的……女生……？\n嘿嘿、嘿嘿……讨厌啦，在下会害羞耶～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1047_006mak", "source_sha256": "5070cf7bf66c13050346dc5d37e7079c99aafc10e0d5b7e904237eee6ad0c513", "ja": "よぉし、それじゃ、どんどんいってみよう！\n見ててね、育！　ボクの全力の女の子っぷりを！！", "zh": "好～那在下就继续示范吧！\n看好啰，育！在下使出全力的女孩子气！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1048_p", "source_sha256": "1c1a1e87dc79397e64d3d53170f24d40f28f857296a73ce558d8dbbefdb6cf01", "ja": "（こうして、真の熱血指導の甲斐あって、みんな上手く\nできるように……簡単にはならなかった。でも……）", "zh": "（就这样，真的热血指导发挥功效，\n两人都进步神速……只可惜当然没这么简单。不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1049_006mak", "source_sha256": "c0a4befba8376dcdb436cbcc9eabbc01992ec492c68913a30a51f498bbee549f", "ja": "二人とも、疲れたかい？　ちょっと休憩しようか。", "zh": "你们俩累不累？先休息一下好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1050_030iku", "source_sha256": "ec51dbc09069251b8fc612d2075d1fc6479c18dabf4e293632b5a676217f9b62", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。はい！", "zh": "呼、呼……好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1051_028ari", "source_sha256": "ebba720e9f18759c904b89d9b3f5810bfe77b38dfc4efc40a717f590248601ba", "ja": "ありさ、もうヘトヘトです～……。\nやっぱり、なかなかうまくできません……。", "zh": "亚利沙已经全身无力了……\n果然无法那么顺利呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1052_006mak", "source_sha256": "37502019acd5d3f97f5d6465592cf47e89706083b96896a731529fb7fdbf8c75", "ja": "でも、ふたりとも、魔法少女になるために……女の子の\n夢を守るために、こんなに真剣になれてるんだ。", "zh": "不过，你们俩为了演好魔法少女……\n为了保护女孩子的梦想，这么认真地在练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1053_006mak", "source_sha256": "37b10880a67e4319973fc668bc33233f4e1d8f7c492be4a2f610ea0edb7a1a64", "ja": "だから、大丈夫だよ！　きっと撮影も成功する！\nですよね、{$P$}♪", "zh": "所以，一定没问题的！拍摄一定会成功！\n你说对吧？{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1054_p", "source_sha256": "1d406b5c7e2f75d3fd7b8f2f0c5f766a7ea4036ed1c48f28d524f64c12d20e95", "ja": "そうだな。そういう意味では\n二人とも、もう立派な魔法少女だ！", "zh": "是啊，就这方面来说，\n你们已经是很出色的魔法少女了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1055_030iku", "source_sha256": "d14acc3a549e59c05cbc2f4cb22dd6d95d12b8ca4fff358df7ea6515244a9734", "ja": "わぁ……！\nありがとう、真さん、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "哇……！\n谢谢你们，真姊姊、{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1056_030iku", "source_sha256": "eebdf23f033720055419b171273702cc58520a5ab519027efbaee85747daf8ed", "ja": "亜利沙さん、もっといっぱいがんばって\nはやく真さんみたいになろうね！", "zh": "亚利沙姊姊，我们要更努力练习，\n才能快点变得和真姊姊一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1057_028ari", "source_sha256": "fd1aa1894d49f2ac24de8cf0282099585f98aa4f43156186874bdfe3b437f32e", "ja": "そうですね、育ちゃん！　カンタンにヘトヘトだなんて\n言ってるヒマはありませんでした。頑張りましょう！", "zh": "对呀，小育！现在可没时间轻易喊累了。\n加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1058_006mak", "source_sha256": "d3f8e967ea25f80e29553c573bbdf42f6d51f769b7a4ccf6b1308565c433da8c", "ja": "あははっ、すごいね二人とも！\nそれじゃもうちょっと、頑張ろうか！", "zh": "哈哈！你们两个真了不起！\n那么就再练习一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1059_p", "source_sha256": "26dbf1263b9159bb34d85883b2088ed0d8d65208ea6481fc5d78f0d1fc8927c2", "ja": "（真のおかげで、二人のモチベーションは\nより高くなった。これなら安心だな！）", "zh": "（在真的鼓励之下，育和亚利沙变得更积极了。\n看来可以放心了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1060_p", "source_sha256": "0667d40b3d63d10e5f694e0af7c065473d5c9ddf91b1d305b2aa17509f71d8ea", "ja": "（それじゃ、俺はそろそろ溜まった事務仕事を\n済ませに戻るか。でないと、また律子に怒られ……）", "zh": "（这样我也该回去处理累积下来的事务工作了。\n不然又要被律子骂……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1061_p", "source_sha256": "638359c77aec6f28f65bb4e26707156487a35152128e22284699a17ef2a594dc", "ja": "（ん？　あそこにいるのは……？）", "zh": "（嗯？那个人是……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1062_026yur", "source_sha256": "fd60422be9f5d40bbf4deaa7cb946305f0d8368f4b514f69e46b6c2739539ee7", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nお、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n辛、辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1063_p", "source_sha256": "6f0c3992fe84cd93c28dd5efbae3bd99d30451dc182a6b20b21a1199977eb91c", "ja": "百合子？　お疲れ様……というか、\n元気がなさそうだな。どうかしたのか？", "zh": "百合子？辛苦了……等等，\n你看起来无精打采的。怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1064_026yur", "source_sha256": "b9178f19882e38578cf45b9440f4c49113f3485ce6d9fc0570315df0a2627011", "ja": "その……。\nちょっと相談したいことがあって……。", "zh": "那个……\n我有件事情想和你商量一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_03_1065_p", "source_sha256": "7270aeb3bbc6eb3e07a234a26fb94290860ce44b5d47c305b545791ec9be12ba", "ja": "（百合子……？）", "zh": "（百合子……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
